              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sharon Bolton"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for lunch yesterday and it was excellent. I was asked by a guest for the recipe so that gives it a thumbs up by me. I did use a hand blender and puree it to make a creamy soup rather than one with chunks, as I was serving to someone that was unable to swallow well. They loved it!"
