            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LMichelle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe with great flavor! I will say though, that I changed the soups... instead of using 2 celery and a mushroom, I used a cream of chicken, cream of celery, and a cream of mushroom (the cream of celery and chicken were Campbell's healthy request with less sodium and calories). I, also, as other reviewers, added more cheese...I didn't see how 1 cup of cheese was going to be enough. I think I used about 3 1/2 to 4 cups. I added a little black pepper, and heavy cream. Will make again!",
            "datePublished": "2023-01-16T02:49:21.792Z"
          },
          {
