              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Walter"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used two lbs of home-grown broccoli, added two cups of cheddar and one can each of Cream of Broccoli, Cream of Celery and Broccoli Cheddar soup. Came out nice and thick and creamy, thanks for sharing.",
